# 3. Summary of All Important Functions

### `diffbot_system.hpp` — Declarations

Defines the `DiffBotSystem` class, its functions, and its variables.

### `diffbot_system.cpp` — Implementation

| Function | What It Does | When to Inspect |
|---|---|---|
| `on_init()` | Loads parameters from URDF | Configuration errors |
