# 4. Quick Troubleshooting Guide

| Problem | Check First |
|---|---|
| Robot moves too fast | Controller velocity limits, then `kMaximumWheelSpeed` |
| Robot turns too fast | `angular.z.max_velocity`, `wheel_separation` |
| Robot moves 1 m but odometry says 2 m | `encoder_cpr_`, `wheel_radius` |
| Robot turns 90°, odometry says 120° | `wheel_separation`, encoder calibration |
| Robot moves backward instead of forward | Wheel direction/sign convention in firmware and controller |
| Encoders show zero | Arduino firmware, `read()`, `process_line()` |
| Serial connection fails | `serial_port`, permissions, `open_serial()` |
| Telemetry timeout errors | Arduino output, CRC, `serial_timeout_ms_` |
| Robot model doesn't align in RViz | TF frames, URDF, odometry |
| Map shifts when the robot moves | Encoder odometry, TF, SLAM configuration |
| Robot doesn't stop reliably | `on_deactivate()`, Arduino command timeout |

